! ###############################################################################################
! ##### Always begin comment with "! " in the beginning, vertical space dosen't matter.  ########      
! ##### However sequence of each input parameters is fixed                               ########
! ##### Donot modify order the order of parameters                                       ########
! ###############################################################################################

! ===========[ MACHINE PARAMETERS ]==================!

13600                                 ! center of mass energy
170				      ! invmass base value
10				      ! step size added on top of base
1				      ! max # of iteration on invmass

! ===========[ OUTPUT OF A RUN SUMMARY ]==================!

run_00				      !directory name to save output
1				      !print data to summary( ON=1/OFF=0 )

! ===========[ LHAPDF NAME ]==================!

MMHT2014lo68cl			! LO pdf 
MMHT2014nlo68cl			! NLO pdf 

! ===========[ VEGAS INPUT ]==================!

5E+5                            ! VEGAS points        [ real-dipole ]
10                              ! VEGAS iterations    [ real-dipole ]

1E+5                            ! VEGAS points        [ virtual + eikonal ]
10                              ! VEGAS iterations    [ virtual + eikonal ]

1E+7    5E+6                    ! VEGAS points        [ PK_Regular & PK_Delta terms ]
10      10                      ! VEGAS iterations    [ PK_Regular & PK_Delta terms ]

5E+6                            ! VEGAS points        [ LO ]
10                              ! VEGAS iterations    [ LO ]

1E+7    5E+6                    ! VEGAS points        [ PK_Plus: Born+1 & Born kinematics ]
10      10                      ! VEGAS iterations    [ PK_Plus: Born+1 & Born kinematics ]

! ===========[ FILE NAMES ]==================!

LO.dat 					| Leading Order contribution
real.dat 				| Real emission (dipole subtraction) contribution
virtual.dat 				| Virtual correction contribution
PK.dat 					| Combined PK result using Plus Distribution regulat and delta
PK_Plus.dat 				| Plus distribution contribution only
PK_Regular.dat 				| Regular (non-singular) term contribution
PK_Delta.dat 				| Delta-function (coefficient) contribution

! ============== below filenames are used to read summary data files ===============

LO_all.dat 				| Combined summary of LO results
LO_ref.dat 				| Reference LO result (e.g. from a benchmark or older run)
real_all.dat 				| Combined summary of real emission results
real_ref.dat 				| Reference real emission result
virtual_all.dat 			| Combined summary of virtual correction results
virtual_ref.dat 			| Reference virtual correction result
PK_all.dat 				| Combined PK result summary
PK_ref.dat 				| Reference PK result
PK_Plus_all.dat 			| Summary of Plus distribution contributions
PK_Regular_all.dat 			| Summary of Regular (non-singular) contributions
PK_Delta_all.dat 			| Summary of Delta-function contributions
NLO_ref.dat 				| Total NLO reference result (often: real + virtual + LO in one file)

! ======[ MODEL PARAMETERS]======= 
128.0					! 1/alew
